[I] OneAPI Deep Neural Network Library

[T] oneDNN (oneAPI Deep Neural Network Library) is an open-source,
[T] cross-platform performance library of basic building blocks for deep
[T] learning applications. It is optimized for x86-64 and AArch64 CPUs and
[T] Intel graphics, with experimental support for other GPUs, PPC64, s390x
[T] and RISC-V, and is used by deep learning frameworks to accelerate their
[T] workloads.

[U] https://github.com/uxlfoundation/oneDNN

[A] One-dnn Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

